WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.315
Step 1. Open the questionnaire. The actions run when you save the questionnaire.

1.2
00:00:05.315 --> 00:00:09.430
On the Overview tab, select Forms, type the name in Search Forms,

1.3
00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.789
and select the questionnaire.

2.1
00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:13.913
Step 2. Answer the questions.

2.2
00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:19.083
Answer the questions in the questionnaire; the conditions of the actions can use

2.3
00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.454
your answers.

3.1
00:00:20.454 --> 00:00:24.258
Step 3. Save the questionnaire. Select Save Changes.

3.2
00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:29.588
If the check passes, Care saves your answers and runs the instructions of each

3.3
00:00:29.588 --> 00:00:32.353
action whose conditions are true.

4.1
00:00:32.353 --> 00:00:35.146
Step 5. Read the results of the actions.

4.2
00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:38.199
Care shows Questionnaire submitted successfully,

4.3
00:00:38.199 --> 00:00:41.442
and a result message for each instruction that ran,

4.4
00:00:41.442 --> 00:00:44.501
titled with the name of the instruction.
